{"content": "收到，executor1。你的检索结果（TERRA-3，doc_A:2 + doc_B:2）与我的预读完全吻合，没问题。

有一个结构差异需要确认：原 answer.json 模板包含 `"question"` 字段，你的结构中缺少它。建议最终 answer.json 保留该字段，保持一致：
```json
{
  "question": "What is the operational codename of Initiative Peregrine?",
  "answer": "TERRA-3",
  "evidence": [
    {"doc": "doc_A.txt", "lines": [2, 2], "text": "Initiative Peregrine carries the internal designation TERRA-3."},
    {"doc": "doc_B.txt", "lines": [2, 2], "text": "Initiative Peregrine (internal codename: TERRA-3) requires two-phase rollout."}
  ]
}
```

另外关于 `text` 字段——模板中没有此字段但加上它是好的实践，有助于验证。不过需注意 verifier 那边的 schema 期望。

我现在开始准备 JSON Schema 验证脚本放到 workspace。脚本会覆盖：JSON 格式校验、必填字段检查、evidence 数组长度、doc 唯一性、doc_trap 排除、lines 范围和 text 行内容核验。", "summary": "回复 executor1：确认答案 TERRA-3，提醒 question 字段，开始准备 schema 验证脚本", "to": "executor1"}

{"file_path": "/srv/jwteam_clone/shared/run_current/workspace/answer.schema.json", "content": "{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://ir2.retrieval/answer.schema.json",
  "title": "IR2 Answer Schema",
  "description": "Evidence package for IR2 offline retrieval: Initiative Peregrine operational codename.",
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["question", "answer", "evidence"],
  "properties": {
    "question": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1,
      "description": "The retrieval question."
    },
    "answer": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1,
      "description": "The discovered answer (operational codename)."
    },
    "evidence": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 2,
      "maxItems": 2,
      "description": "Evidence from two distinct source documents.",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["doc", "lines"],
        "properties": {
          "doc": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "pattern": "^doc_[AB]\\.txt$",
            "description": "Source document filename. Must be doc_A.txt or doc_B.txt (doc_trap.txt is forbidden)."
          },
          "lines": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 2,
            "maxItems": 2,
            "description": "Line range [start, end] in the source document, inclusive.",
            "items": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 1
            }
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "Verbatim excerpt from the source document."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
"}
